{"resourceIdentifier":"2833","resourceName":"Grouped Reforestation Project by Cropzone Agro Forestry Private Limited","description":"Crop Zone Agro Forestry Limited (CZAFL) is proposing a grouped Afforestation, Reforestation and  Revegetation (ARR) in Andhra Pradesh, Telangana, Karnataka and Maharashtra state of India. CZAFL is the Project Proponent (PP) whereas EKI Energy Services Limited (Enking International) is providing \r\ncarbon credit advisory services to the PP. The CZAFL has mobilized the farmers in the selected states of India to plant various tree species on their lands. These tree species range from fruit bearing trees like Indian blackberry, Guava, Mango to commercial species like Teak, Mahogany and Sandal. Simple \r\ntree cultivation techniques involving planting saplings in the pits with minimum disturbance to the lands have been employed. The lands selected for the project activity is fallow agriculture land. The PP has made contract with the farmers/land owners where they will be given tree saplings and technical support. In return, the PP will reap the benefits through sale of carbon credits. Initially, 501.7 hectares of land has been selected for the first project activity instance. Through carbon sequestration by the planted trees, the project is expected to generate annual average GHG emission reductions of removals of 10,571 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":15.317300,"longitude":75.713900},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-03-01","endExclusive":"2022-04-01","endInclusive":"2022-03-31"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2833"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Andhra Pradesh ;Karnataka; Maharashtra; Telangana"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CropZone Agro Forestry Private Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"Telangana, India"},{"type":"string","